{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08733","headline":"过汪氏别业二首 一 · 李白","name":"过汪氏别业二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游山谁可游，子明与浮丘。\n叠岭碍河汉，连峰横斗牛。\n汪生面北阜，池馆清且幽。\n我来感意气，搥炰列珍羞。\n扫石待归月，开池涨寒流。\n酒酣益爽气，爲乐不知秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}